Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:52.79,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}What do you want again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:56.30,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我是代表别人来的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:56.30,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'm repping some people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.34,0:02:58.65,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他们想找个好手制毒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.34,0:02:58.65,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah. They want to get to the good cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:00.90,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他们可以和你或者IC兄弟会交易
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:00.90,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}They'll trade you or the IC Brotherhood,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.90,0:03:04.10,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}都听你的 可卡因换冰毒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.90,0:03:04.10,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}however you want to do it, coke for crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.34,0:03:09.17,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}迈尔斯怎么没来?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.34,0:03:09.17,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Why am I not talking to Miles?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.18,0:03:11.87,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我和金杰认识很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.18,0:03:11.87,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Oh, me and Ginger go way back,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.15,0:03:13.69,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}出生入死
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.15,0:03:13.69,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}boosted together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:16.88,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你话可不多
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:16.88,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You ain't saying much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:19.14,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我想让他给你介绍情况
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:19.14,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I figure I let my man give you the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:21.10,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}听着 我手上的货
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:21.10,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Look. This shit I got,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:23.44,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不管你怎么戒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:23.44,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}you can step on it 5, 6 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.44,0:03:24.99,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}都戒不掉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.44,0:03:24.99,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It'll still kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.03,0:03:27.01,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你不用做多少就能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.03,0:03:27.01,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Just means you got to cook a little more
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.01,0:03:28.63,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}赚一大笔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.01,0:03:28.63,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}for a lot more profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.46,0:03:33.36,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.46,0:03:33.36,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.28,0:03:37.36,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不管是毒品还是钱 我都用不上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.28,0:03:37.36,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I ain't go no use for it or your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.18,0:03:40.18,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你的钱花不完吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.18,0:03:40.18,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}What, money don't spend?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:45.61,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我可以从你的双眼中看到你的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:45.61,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I can see your soul at the edges of your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.32,0:03:48.83,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}而它被腐蚀了 像是酸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.32,0:03:48.83,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It's corrosive, like acid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:52.48,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你心里有只魔鬼 小子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:52.48,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You got a demon, little man,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.46,0:03:55.18,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}而且我不喜欢你的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.46,0:03:55.18,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and I don't like your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:57.63,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}让我想要对它动动手脚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:57.63,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It makes me want to do things to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.75,0:04:03.60,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}金杰 你再找我我就让迈尔斯去找你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.75,0:04:03.60,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Ginger, you call me again, I'm setting Miles on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.17,0:04:07.36,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}再让我看到你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.17,0:04:07.36,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I see you again,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:10.02,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}就等着被我收拾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:10.02,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'm putting you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.37,0:04:13.45,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你身上被阴影覆盖着 孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.37,0:04:13.45,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}There's a shadow on you, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.44,0:04:41.54,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}马蒂 你跟上他了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.44,0:04:41.54,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Marty, you got him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.88,0:04:43.99,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你最好跟上了 我可遭了不少罪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.88,0:04:43.99,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You fucking better, the shit I've been though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.99,0:04:45.59,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}是的 我跟上他了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.99,0:04:45.59,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I do. I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.41,0:04:47.32,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}路上没什么车
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.41,0:04:47.32,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We're on empty roads now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.32,0:04:49.88,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}所以我必须远远跟着 不然他会发现的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.32,0:04:49.88,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}So I got to drop back, or he'll spot the tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.88,0:04:52.98,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}好 那是雷吉 勒杜的制毒同伙德沃尔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.88,0:04:52.98,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}OK. That's Reggie Ledoux's cook partner Dewall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.14,0:04:53.92,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}跟紧他 马蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.14,0:04:53.92,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Birddog him, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.92,0:04:54.90,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.92,0:04:54.90,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.26,0:04:56.53,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你的位置在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.26,0:04:56.53,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}What's your location?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.19,0:05:00.13,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}I-10公路南段 沿着克里奥尔自然步道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.19,0:05:00.13,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Just south of I-10 along the Creole Nature Trail
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:01.58,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}朝卡尔里斯的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:01.58,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}heading towards Carlyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.90,0:05:03.01,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}快点 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.90,0:05:03.01,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Hurry up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.07,0:05:04.99,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}知道了 这就来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.07,0:05:04.99,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Copy that. On my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:21.42,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}后面感觉如何 金杰?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:21.42,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}How we doing back there, Ginger?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.66,0:05:24.99,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}操你妈 混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.66,0:05:24.99,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Fuck you, motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.77,0:05:28.32,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}爽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.77,0:05:28.32,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.53,0:05:33.41,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你是怎么找到勒杜的?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.53,0:05:33.41,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}How'd you get onto Ledoux?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.51,0:05:35.57,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}从我以前的一个线人那里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.51,0:05:35.57,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}One of my old CI's tipped me off
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.57,0:05:38.42,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}问道了他的制毒窝点的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.57,0:05:38.42,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}to the location of his cook house.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.54,0:05:41.80,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}所以我就开始干活了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.54,0:05:41.80,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}So I came back on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.91,0:05:47.16,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不希望别人抓住他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.91,0:05:47.16,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Didn't want anybody else to catch him, bring him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.48,0:05:51.01,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}看 你们想让我帮忙?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.48,0:05:51.01,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Look. You want my help?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.37,0:05:53.60,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}就把档案剩下的部分给我看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.37,0:05:53.60,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Just show me the rest of the file.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:56.40,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}为什么你这么想知道有什么新发现?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:56.40,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Why are you so hot to see the new discovery file, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.95,0:06:00.31,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}那为什么你们...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.95,0:06:00.31,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, why are y'all...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.24,0:06:04.32,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这么不想让我知道?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.24,0:06:04.32,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}so hot to not give it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.33,0:06:07.97,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不是说要一起讨论吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.33,0:06:07.97,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It's supposed to be like a consultation, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.02,0:06:12.16,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}是 但是你先来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.02,0:06:12.16,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah, but you go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.51,0:06:13.92,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你先说一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.51,0:06:13.92,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You take me through it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.92,0:06:15.74,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}然后我再告诉你我们掌握了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.92,0:06:15.74,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and I'll let you see what we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.48,0:06:22.07,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}那你可得信守诺言
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.48,0:06:22.07,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'll hold you to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.11,0:06:50.15,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}金杰在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.11,0:06:50.15,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Where's Ginger?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.41,0:06:53.18,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}捆好扔水沟里了 有什么发现?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.41,0:06:53.18,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Wrapped up in a ditch. What you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.80,0:06:55.70,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我跟丢他了 调了好几次头
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.80,0:06:55.70,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, lost him and then had to double back
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.70,0:06:58.22,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}才找到出口
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.70,0:06:58.22,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}a few times till I found the exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:06:59.67,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他的卡车在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:06:59.67,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}That's his truck there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.80,0:07:02.67,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们得呼叫总部 拉斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.80,0:07:02.67,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We're gonna have to call this in, Rust.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.73,0:07:05.32,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}最好别这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.73,0:07:05.32,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Eh, we don't want to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.16,0:07:07.82,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}大部队一来 把这片林子一包围
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.16,0:07:07.82,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Troops will come, flood these woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:08.99,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他们就四散逃窜了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:08.99,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}They could scatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.51,0:07:14.64,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}好吧 那我们在这里也找不到他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.51,0:07:14.64,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}All right. We ain't gonna find him from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.03,0:07:22.62,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你打过猎吗? 马蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.03,0:07:22.62,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You ever been hunting, Marty?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:25.61,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}打过...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:25.61,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Uh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.02,0:07:30.06,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}前年隔着四十五米打过十叉雄鹿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.02,0:07:30.06,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}10-point buck year before last, 50 yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.34,0:07:33.99,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我说的不是埋伏在树屋里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.34,0:07:33.99,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'm not talking about sitting in a treehouse
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.99,0:07:35.43,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}等着一头雄鹿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.99,0:07:35.43,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}waiting to ambush a buck coming
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:37.30,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}前来嗅你的诱饵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:37.30,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}to sniff your gash bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.59,0:07:38.86,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我说的是追踪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.59,0:07:38.86,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Talking about tracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.09,0:07:40.74,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}天呐 你真是个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.09,0:07:40.74,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Jesus, you're a prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:42.64,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}听着 我们找到地放 回到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:42.64,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Look. We find the place. We come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.64,0:07:43.99,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}然后呼叫总部
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.64,0:07:43.99,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We call it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:46.00,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}留一个人监视 行吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:46.00,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}One of us stays surveillance, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.45,0:07:48.61,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我看行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.45,0:07:48.61,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I can live with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.59,0:07:51.46,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.59,0:07:51.46,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.94,0:07:53.75,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你知道勒杜在哪里制毒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.94,0:07:53.75,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Now, you got a tip where Ledoux cooks,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.75,0:07:57.09,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}而科尔从他所在的地方回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.75,0:07:57.09,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and Cohle came back from wherever he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.72,0:07:59.40,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你知道最终会到这一步的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.72,0:07:59.40,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You knew it was gonna get here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.89,0:08:02.39,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}就这一次 说点真的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.89,0:08:02.39,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Just the once, the way you tell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.49,0:08:06.95,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我会把我在休斯敦与比洛克西之间的每个靶场
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.49,0:08:06.95,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'll tell it the same way that I told the shooting board
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.95,0:08:10.95,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}和警察酒吧说过的故事再说一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.95,0:08:10.95,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and every cop bar between Houston and Biloxi,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.95,0:08:12.18,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你知道为什么十七年来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.95,0:08:12.18,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and you know why the story is
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.18,0:08:15.23,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我的说法都是一样的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.18,0:08:15.23,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}always the same 17 years gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:18.01,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}因为事情就是这么发生的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:18.01,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Because it only went down the one way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:22.81,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}拉斯特的爸爸教他怎么用弓箭狩猎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:22.81,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Now, Rust's dad taught him bowhunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.94,0:08:26.93,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你得一直追踪猎物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.94,0:08:26.93,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You know, you had to track game till you got
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:29.41,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}直到相距只有二十七米
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:29.41,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}within maybe 30 yards of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.88,0:08:42.91,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这使我们能够辨别出嫌犯的行进路线
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.88,0:08:42.91,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Now, this enabled us to discern the suspect's path
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:45.70,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}以及避过他们安装的大量的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:45.70,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}while sidestepping various
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.70,0:08:48.53,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}防入侵装置
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.70,0:08:48.53,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}anti-intruder devices they installed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:08.15,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}从刚才的绊线来看 这片空地可能是片雷区
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:08.15,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Tripwires back there. Clearing is probably mined.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.28,0:10:12.00,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}好吧 你打算怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.28,0:10:12.00,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}All right. How you want to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.49,0:10:16.39,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你回去叫支援来 我在这等
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.49,0:10:16.39,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You go back. Call it in. I'll wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.83,0:10:21.08,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}- 你会待在这里吗? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.83,0:10:21.08,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}- You're gonna hold position? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.26,0:10:28.67,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}快去 马蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.26,0:10:28.67,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Do it now, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.90,0:10:30.79,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}去你的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.90,0:10:30.79,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:33.07,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你别想单干
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:33.07,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You ain't doing this without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.73,0:10:48.99,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}好吧 小心前进
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.73,0:10:48.99,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}All right. Stay low.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.93,0:10:56.89,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们刚要返回
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.93,0:10:56.89,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We were just about to turn back,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.89,0:10:59.27,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}呼叫教区 州警的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.89,0:10:59.27,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}call in parish, state, whoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.27,0:11:01.55,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们知道了确切的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.27,0:11:01.55,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I mean, we had the location.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.55,0:11:05.08,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们在那地方认出了嫌犯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.55,0:11:05.08,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We had our suspects identified at the location, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.48,0:11:07.38,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}干脆把这桩破事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.48,0:11:07.38,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Might as well just leave the shit be
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:08.72,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}移交给特别小组吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:08.72,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and hand it off.
