Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.07,0:11:11.61,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}That ain't what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.60,0:11:16.78,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}就在我们准备回去的时候...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.60,0:11:16.78,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}No. As soon as we started to back off, man...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.78,0:11:17.74,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}砰
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.78,0:11:17.74,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Blam!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.39,0:11:20.51,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}子弹差点打中拉斯特的头
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.39,0:11:20.51,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Bullets cut through right near Rust's head.
