Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.51,0:11:24.47,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We dove opposite ways into the high growth,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.47,0:11:26.00,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}但是他们发现了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.47,0:11:26.00,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}but they'd already spotted us,
