Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:28.58,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and they had something high-velocity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.58,0:11:32.71,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}砰 把我们俩之间的树都轰了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.58,0:11:32.71,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Boom! Blew apart this tree between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.71,0:11:34.45,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}就这么开打了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.71,0:11:34.45,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I mean, it was on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:40.67,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}各类炮火...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:40.67,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Heavy shit...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.67,0:11:43.28,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}就像蕨类植物一样在我们周围爆开
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.67,0:11:43.28,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}like ferns and whatnot bursting all around us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.28,0:11:44.74,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}树皮从树上掉落下来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.28,0:11:44.74,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}bark flying off of trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.74,0:11:47.00,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们身处枪林弹雨之中
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.74,0:11:47.00,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I mean we were in a bucket shitstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.24,0:12:12.10,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}操
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.24,0:12:12.10,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:09.85,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}州警
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:09.85,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}State police.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.87,0:13:11.46,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}把手放在头上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.87,0:13:11.46,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Put your hands on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.44,0:13:14.12,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}快把手放在头上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.44,0:13:14.12,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Put them on your head now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.64,0:13:16.13,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}别想耍花招
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.64,0:13:16.13,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.36,0:13:19.20,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}马上把手放在头上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.36,0:13:19.20,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Put your hands on your head right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.69,0:13:21.29,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}紧扣手指
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.69,0:13:21.29,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Intertwine your fingers.
