Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.47,0:13:32.62,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Down on your knees. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.26,0:13:39.77,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}是时候了 不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.26,0:13:39.77,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It's time, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.80,0:13:43.13,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}黑星
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.80,0:13:43.13,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}The black stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.13,0:13:44.74,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}闭上你的嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.13,0:13:44.74,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Shut the fuck up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.47,0:14:00.70,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他们在我们穿过树林之前就发现我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.47,0:14:00.70,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}They'd spotted us before we crossed the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.70,0:14:05.51,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们只能在躲在水里 等待机会
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.70,0:14:05.51,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}So all we could do was duck for cover, dig in,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.80,0:14:07.35,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}想办法靠近他们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.80,0:14:07.35,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}try getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.03,0:14:10.59,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}场面一片混乱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.03,0:14:10.59,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It was chaos.
