Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.77,0:39:42.63,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Nothing can become.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.20,0:39:45.82,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}没有什么会改变
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.20,0:39:45.82,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Nothing changes.
