Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.68,0:39:51.24,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}So death created time
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.62,0:39:54.24,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}让万物生长然后归于死亡...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.62,0:39:54.24,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}to grow the things that it would kill...
