Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.11,0:40:05.45,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}that you've always been born into.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.40,0:40:09.96,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这种对话我们有过多少次了 警探们?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.40,0:40:09.96,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I mean, how many times have we had this conversation, detectives?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.15,0:40:12.85,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}天知道?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.15,0:40:12.85,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.51,0:40:18.41,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}当你想不起自己的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.51,0:40:18.41,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}When you can't remember your lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.63,0:40:22.60,Chinese,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}无法改变自己的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.63,0:40:22.60,English,NTP,0000,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}you can't change your lives,
